                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Republicans are openly admitting they want 4 million Americans to lose coverage and 25 million to pay higher premiums. \n\nHow can the health and livelihoods of millions of American families mean that little to them? \n\nIf Democrats were in control, these subsidies would already be extended, just as we did in the American Rescue Plan and Inflation Reduction Act.",
