                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "No, @SpeakerJohnson, extending ACA enhanced tax credits isn\u2019t a \u201cDecember policy issue.\u201d Open enrollment starts Nov 1.\n\nIf they\u2019re not extended in time, 15 million will see premiums spike and 3 million will lose coverage.\n\nAmerican families can\u2019t wait. Congress must include this in the CR.",
